1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,150
Welcome back, Professor!

2
00:00:04,645 --> 00:00:06,145
Yes, we're in trouble.

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:10,000
Specter seems to be plotting something
terrible at his Moon base.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,320
Looks like you're all here.
But this is the end.

5
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:23,800
You can't change back without
this Nano Card I'm holding.

6
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,280
And what's more, the giant
Nano Cannon is almost complete.

7
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,980
Once it's complete...

8
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:37,070
...I can shrink all of humanity
to your size in an instant.

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:42,500
- Earth will belong to the monkeys!
- What are you talking about?

10
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:47,480
If you shrink the whole Earth,
even monkeys won't be able to live on it!

11
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:52,150
The Nano Cannon that shrank you was
a prototype that shrinks everything.

12
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:58,500
But this giant Nano Cannon reads
genetic data and shrinks only humans.

13
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:11,080
Soon you'll have lots more little friends
like you, so look forward to it.

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,500
Bye-bye.

15
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:16,910
- Professor, what do we do?
- Don't panic.

16
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:24,240
The Nano Card White had should hold the data
to warp to Specter's Moon base.

17
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:30,500
- Natsumi, can you analyze it?
- Okay, I'll try.

18
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:33,780
Kakeru, if that Nano Cannon is fired...

19
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:39,200
...humanity won't stand a chance.
We must stop it at all costs!

20
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:42,700
- Leave it to me!
- Professor, we can warp to Specter's base now!

21
00:01:49,970 --> 00:01:52,600
All right. Just you wait, Specter!

